{"url": "https://gmdcbaghbar.ac.in/academics/departments.php", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://gmdcbaghbar.ac.in/academics/departments.php", "text": "GOVT. MODEL DEGREE COLLEGE, BAGHBAR\nচৰকাৰী আদৰ্শ স্নাতক মহাবিদ্যালয়,বাঘবৰ\nGOVT. MODEL DEGREE COLLEGE,BAGBHAR\nESTD. 2023\nNotice\nAlumni Portal\nInstitutional MOOCs\nE-Content\nGrievances\nConnect\r\n                                Us on\nHome\nAbout Us\nHistory\nPrincipal's Desk\nMission & Vision\nAdministration\nGoverning Body\nAcademics\nDepartments\nFaculty Members\nAdmission\nAdmission Portal\nEvents\nIQAC\nAbout IQAC\nAQAR\nSSR\nNIRF\nIQAC Meetings\nProcedure for Maintenance of Facilities\nBest Practices\nInstitutional Distinctiveness\nCode of Conduct\nFacilities\nAcademic\nCampus\nResidential\nLibrary\nDigital Library\nCanteen\ne-Publication\nResources\nLibrary\nNAAC\nStudent Corner\nTime Table\nSyllabus\nScholarship\nResults\nExam Form Fillup\nExam Schedule\nAnti Ragging\nDownloads\nFeedback\nStudent Feedback\nLogin\nStudent Login\nStaff Login\nAdmin Login\nVisitors Note\nSuggestions\nAcademic Departments\nExploring diverse fields of knowledge in the Arts and Humanities.\nOverview of Academics\nGovt. Model Degree College, Baghbar is committed to providing quality higher education to the students of the region. Currently, the college focuses on the\nBachelor of Arts (B.A.)\nstream, offering a variety of core and elective subjects. Our dedicated faculty members ensure that students receive a comprehensive education that fosters critical thinking, cultural awareness, and civic responsibility.\nDetailed syllabi, faculty profiles, and departmental routines will be updated shortly as per the latest academic calendar.\nDepartments (Faculty of Arts)\nAssamese\nFocuses on the rich literary heritage, linguistics, and cultural history of Assam. Offers comprehensive studies in modern and classical Assamese literature.\nExplore\nEnglish\nExplores British, American, and Indian literature in English. Aims to enhance communication skills and critical literary analysis.\nExplore\nPolitical Science\nStudies political theories, government systems, and international relations to prepare students for active civic engagement and leadership.\nExplore\nEducation\nProvides foundational knowledge in educational philosophy, psychology, and methodology. Essential for aspiring teachers and educators.\nExplore\nHistory\nExamines ancient, medieval, and modern historical events. Helps students understand the complexities of human civilization over time.\nExplore\nEconomics\nExplores micro and macroeconomic theories, policies, and issues. Prepares students for analytical and policy-oriented careers.\nExplore\nMore Departments\nInformation will be added soon.\nContact Us\nGOVT. MODEL DEGREE COLLEGE, BAGHBAR\nJahanar Ghola, Mandia\nBarpeta, Assam, India PIN : 781308\nadmin@gmdcbaghbar.ac.in\nOffice: +91 70028 68034\nUseful Links\nUGC\nNAAC\nIDOL\nGU PORTAL\nDHE\nSHODHGANGA\nNational Digital Library\nNPTEL\nUseful Links\nBhattadev University\nGAUHATI UNIVERSITY\nASSAM UNIVERSITY\nDIBRUGARH UNIVERSITY\nProject OSCAR\nNCERT\nQuick Links\nOnline Portal\nTenders\nNotice\nAcademic Calendar\nGallery\nCopyright © 2026 GOVT. MODEL DEGREE COLLEGE, BAGHBAR\nPowered By\nIndilens Web Solutions Private Limited", "links": [{"label": "চৰকাৰী আদৰ্শ স্নাতক মহাবিদ্যালয়,বাঘবৰ GOVT. MODEL DEGREE COLLEGE,BAGBHAR ESTD. 2023", "url": "https://gmdcbaghbar.ac.in/index.php"}, {"label": "Notice", "url": "https://gmdcbaghbar.ac.in/notices.php"}, {"label": "Alumni Portal", "url": "https://gmdcbaghbar.ac.in/alumni/index.php"}, {"label": "Institutional MOOCs", "url": "https://gmdcbaghbar.ac.in/resources/moocs.php"}, {"label": "E-Content", "url": "https://gmdcbaghbar.ac.in/resources/econtent.php"}, {"label": "Grievances", "url": "https://gmdcbaghbar.ac.in/feedback/grievances.php"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/p/Govt-Model-Degree-College-Baghbar-%E0%A6%9A%E0%A7%B0%E0%A6%95%E0%A6%BE%E0%A